    <h1><i class="fa fa-apple-whole"></i> How to Use the Pomodoro Timer</h1>
    <ol>
      <li><b>Set your timer:</b> Choose your work duration and break length.</li>
      <li><b>Start your session:</b> Click "Start" to begin focused work.</li>
      <li><b>Take breaks:</b> When the timer ends, take a short break, then repeat.</li>
      <li><b>Repeat cycles:</b> After several Pomodoros, take a longer break.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>
      The Pomodoro Technique helps you stay productive and focused by breaking work into short intervals, with regular breaks for rest.
    </p>
    <p>
      <b>Tip:</b> Track how many Pomodoros you complete each day to build good habits!
    </p>
